## Hydroponics

::bg{location="hydroponics" time="ship-night"}
::music{action="start" mood="quiet" volume="muted"}
::auto{character="vesna" anchor="starboard" action="drift"}

@vesna{code="0010" emotion="level"}: Careful. The mats are the only thing aboard still doing the job it was built for.
@vesna{code="0020" emotion="wry"}: Nine trays of lettuce, outperforming the entire crew.
@narrator{code="0030"}: Condensation stood on the inside of the hull. Behind it, nothing at all.

::assert{knows(vesna, manifest)}
@vesna{code="0040" emotion="clipped"}: I pulled the manifest while you were walking. Hydroponics is module nine.
@vesna{code="0050" emotion="level"}: The schedule goes in order, and it does not skip.

<match on="run.shedPressure">
<when test="$ >= 2">
@vesna{code="0060" emotion="stricken"}: It moved twice while you were in the bank. I was counting.
</when>
<when test="$ == 1">
@vesna{code="0070" emotion="frayed"}: It moved once while you were in the bank. I was counting.
</when>
<otherwise>
@vesna{code="0080" emotion="level"}: It hasn't moved since the bank. That's the first good news today.
</otherwise>
</match>

@vesna{code="0090" emotion="level"}: So say it plain. What did you do down there?

<branch id="thePlainAnswer">
<choice id="ownIt" label="Tell her exactly what you did">
::set{run.vesnaTrust += 1}
<match on="run.shedPressure">
<when test="$ >= 2">
@vesna{code="0100" emotion="stricken"}: Two pods, two modules. Now you know the exchange rate.
</when>
<when test="$ == 1">
@vesna{code="0110" emotion="frayed"}: One. All right. One I can carry.
</when>
<otherwise>
@vesna{code="0120" emotion="wry"}: Nothing. A room full of sleeping people and you picked nothing.
</otherwise>
</match>
@vesna{code="0130" emotion="level"}: Doesn't make it right. Makes it yours. I can work with yours.
</choice>
<choice id="deflect" label="Tell her the schedule was already running">
@vesna{code="0140" emotion="clipped"}: It was. That isn't what I asked.
@vesna{code="0150" emotion="hollowed"}: Keep it, then. Everyone aboard is carrying something.
::auto{character="vesna" action="turn-away"}
</choice>
<choice id="saidNothing" label="Say nothing">
::camera{focus="vesna" zoom="1.15" duration="1.4" wait="true"}
@vesna{code="0160" emotion="hollowed"}: That's an answer too.
::auto{character="vesna" action="turn-away"}
</choice>
</branch>

@vesna{code="0170" emotion="level"}: Nine trays. When it takes this module, we stop pretending we're a crew and start being cargo.
